msgid "https://lionheart-group.github.io/template-oriented-form-utilities/"
msgstr "https://lionheart-group.github.io/template-oriented-form-utilities/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: template-oriented-form-utilities.php
msgid "Template-Oriented Form Utilities is a WordPress plugin that provides a set of utilities for handling forms in a template-oriented manner."
msgstr "Template-Oriented Form Utilitiesは、テンプレート指向でフォームを扱うためのユーティリティを提供するWordPressプラグインです。"

#. Author of the plugin
#: template-oriented-form-utilities.php
msgid "lionheartgroup"
msgstr "lionheartgroup"

